From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] FreeChat: admin-only auto-delete, burn after reading,
 no deleted placeholders

- Room auto-delete can only be changed by room admins (power level 100 or
  v12 creators); others see the setting with an explanation
- Security & Privacy (user settings): default burn-after-read delay for
  my messages, stored as com.freechat.disappearing account data
- Room Security & Privacy: per-chat override, or follow the default
- Every deleted message disappears without a placeholder, like Telegram
  (deleted thread roots stay so threads remain reachable)
